      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 3 (Symbols): Defines 31 abbreviations and acronyms used throughout the specification, from 3T-SBOM, ABNF, AI, and BOM through CVSS, EPSS, JSON-LD, KEV, OWL, PURL, RDF, SBOM, SHACL, SPDX, SSVC, SWHID, and VEX.",
