      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 4 (Terms and definitions): Cites the ISO Online Browsing Platform and IEC Electropedia terminological databases and defines the term 'profile' as a targeted scope of SPDX usage identifying the namespaces, classes, properties, and custom constraints for a specific use case.",
