          "text": "Section 5.1 (Alternate notation for some conformance requirements): Explains how property cardinality assertions are expressed using `minCount` (minimum 0) and `maxCount` (unbounded `*`), alongside `0..1`, `0..*`, `1..1`, and `1..*` range notations.",
