          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-016",
      "source": "sections/sec-016-core-profile-compliance-point.md",
      "source_hash": "359018e030b2a042da2ba60f8a900354cf9083efe7ad24d2760c4df80f6aa04a",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 5.3 (Core Profile compliance point): Specifies the mandatory Core Profile providing foundational classes, properties, and vocabularies across all SPDX profiles, requiring conforming software to import and export documents in at least one defined SPDX serialization format.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-017",
      "source": "sections/sec-017-software-profile-compliance-point.md",
      "source_hash": "c60cfcc0c105d60799f99fe310277744a0f4430306819856782a3cd85513810c",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 5.4 (Software Profile compliance point): Specifies conformance requirements for the Software Profile covering classes, properties, and vocabularies for software artifacts, which together with the Core Profile forms the baseline for SBOM interchange without requiring support for other optional profiles.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-018",
      "source": "sections/sec-018-security-profile-compliance-point.md",
      "source_hash": "3808974a025515182ea46efd9cade43a1bb950b5707baf3c55ea606de222f7ac",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 5.5 (Security Profile compliance point): Specifies conformance requirements for exchanging software vulnerability, severity, exploitability, and remediation information under the Security Profile without entailing support for other optional profiles.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-019",
      "source": "sections/sec-019-licensing-profile-compliance-point.md",
      "source_hash": "b942d302f26c52ff2c303a7a8c18792c5f72fa6e87f14f4de0b09b8d3d1f5f4b",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 5.6 (Licensing Profile compliance point): Specifies conformance requirements for exchanging software licensing and intellectual property metadata—encompassing both the SimpleLicensing and ExpandedLicensing profiles, SPDX License Expressions, and the SPDX License List—independently of other optional profiles.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
