      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 5.11 (Extension Profile compliance point): Specifies conformance requirements for the Extension Profile, enabling profile-based element characterization extensions, community-specific metadata, and structured solutions for coverage gaps via subclasses of the abstract `Extension` class.",
