    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-027",
      "source": "sections/sec-027-overview.md",
      "source_hash": "2159d1b795b08e60fb0e756cfabf61bf903e60098f4a125c4bf254c76edd1204",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6.1 (Overview): States that the SPDX data model is based on the Resource Description Framework (RDF) extensible knowledge representation model and can be serialized in multiple formats for storage and transmission.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-028",
      "source": "sections/sec-028-rdf-serialization.md",
      "source_hash": "6e1e8f924aa1ef3e955918d1827bd6b7ed1744e5f2c6ffc5c5a8672ab24ba7a2",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6.2 (RDF serialization): Lists supported RDF serialization formats—including JSON-LD 1.1, RDF 1.1 Turtle, N-Triples, and RDF/XML—and notes the accompanying JSON-LD context file for human-readable JSON-LD serialization.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-029",
      "source": "sections/sec-029-canonical-serialization.md",
      "source_hash": "9b2ced12e4e41e326f776a9c6fb966b88bfa0ebc4f4f64727e11ba1c4da67221",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6.3 (Canonical serialization): Defines the deterministic, single-line RFC 8259 JSON canonical form for SPDX JSON-LD data, specifying rules for double-quoted keys, no external whitespace, lowercase literals (`true`, `false`, `null`), base-10 integers without leading zeros, UTF-8 string escaping, arrays, and lexicographically ordered ASCII object keys.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-030",
      "source": "sections/sec-030-serialization-information.md",
      "source_hash": "cd9d8221792ef40a9d7b376d65cd425c8e4e907de01284116536bcbe485f226d",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6.4 (Serialization information): Explains how an `SpdxDocument` element represents a logical collection of elements across formats while an `Artifact` linked via `serializedInArtifact` represents the physical bytes, allows native format mechanisms such as `@context` prefixes, and requires at most one `SpdxDocument` per serialization instance.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-031",
      "source": "sections/sec-031-serialization-in-json-ld.md",
      "source_hash": "5f9c7fe01f460e9f86207dcde264283bbc6dcf459495957cb03ee8e70bd670e0",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 6.5 (Serialization in JSON-LD) heading and subsection number 6.5.1 introducing the JSON-LD serialization rules.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
