        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-039",
      "source": "sections/sec-039-annotation.md",
      "source_hash": "dc87e4561897d111d82ef5a6365275ef7551c72f726797d6cd87e31e118059d2",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 8.1.2 (`Annotation`): Defines the concrete `/Core/Annotation` class (subclass of `/Core/Element`) for assertions made in relation to an element, specifying direct properties `annotationType` (`1..1`), `contentType` (`0..1`), `statement` (`0..1`), and `subject` (`1..1`) plus inherited `Element` properties.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-040",
      "source": "sections/sec-040-artifact.md",
      "source_hash": "2b6136ee30b0c6f64e48d9a3d940b777ba0271b0164a566be6be2c3bdfebfe23",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 8.1.3 (`Artifact`): Defines the abstract `/Core/Artifact` class (subclass of `/Core/Element`) representing a distinct digital article or unit (file, package, device, or data element), with properties `builtTime`, `originatedBy`, `releaseTime`, `standardName`, `suppliedBy`, `supportLevel`, and `validUntilTime` plus inherited `Element` properties.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-041",
      "source": "sections/sec-041-bom.md",
      "source_hash": "87e004fa88bcba8f4a0a96ab2b0ed75b4f99e3dbcb2c2815f89e5686a9d0563a",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 8.1.4 (`Bom`): Defines the concrete `/Core/Bom` class as a Bill of Materials container grouping SPDX 3.0 content that characterizes a product's composition, provenance, licensing, and quality or security details.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-042",
      "source": "sections/sec-042-bundle.md",
      "source_hash": "5f702b4dd0cc0240add5b0aaed175052abc2d959c109e13cc52318b3c674bfe1",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Continuation of Section 8.1.4 (`Bom`): Lists the superclasses of `/Core/Bom` (`/Core/Bundle`, `/Core/ElementCollection`, and `/Core/Element`) and the beginning of its informative property table (`comment` and `context`).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
