    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-043",
      "source": "sections/sec-043-creationinfo.md",
      "source_hash": "2015e24f4cb04a5049598d30bc957fbf5cfb27deb01bfe58bfee1d0ba191e2f5",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Completes the informative property table for `/Core/Bom` and defines Section 8.1.5 (`Bundle`), the concrete `/Core/Bundle` class (subclass of `ElementCollection` and `Element`) representing a collection of elements sharing a common `context` (`0..1`), along with its full property table.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-044",
      "source": "sections/sec-044-element.md",
      "source_hash": "9e0a4c8af8e50f82312375892d602c2c01e33e9f279ab29ac61871405e089ff8",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Section 8.1.6 (`CreationInfo`): Defines the concrete `/Core/CreationInfo` class recording who created an element and when and how it was created (noting that `created` often reflects the last artifact change date for reproducible builds), with properties `comment` (`0..1`), `created` (`1..1`), `createdBy` (`1..*`), `createdUsing` (`0..*`), and `specVersion` (`1..1`).",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "conversation://60bf5d72-a28c-4963-be20-fa0922d95bc2"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-10-26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/omg-2024-spdx-3-0/blocks/prose-sec-045",
      "source": "sections/sec-045-dictionaryentry.md",
      "source_hash": "d06ddedf22b3ff421e0057c72e48f4bf71cf9cc0e2fac8570e3f1f1f317d2581",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Defines Section 8.1.7 (`DictionaryEntry`), a concrete key-value pair class (`key` `1..1`, `value` `0..1`) for string mappings, and begins Section 8.1.8 (`Element`), the abstract base domain class `/Core/Element` from which all SPDX 3.0 domain classes derive.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
